---
// This fork has no newsletter account. Keep the real upstream destination
// explicit rather than silently subscribing readers to a different project.
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div id="newsletter" class="anchor-offset container-app">
    <div class="card p-8 text-center sm:p-12">
      <span class="pill">▸ follow the project</span>
      <h2 class="heading mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Yaran updates</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[color:var(--color-muted)]">
        Follow the fork on GitHub for development and release history. Yaran
        does not have a newsletter or a claimed public website domain.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="https://github.com/SiavZ/yaran" class="btn-primary">Yaran repository</a>
        <a href="https://getdux.app/#newsletter" class="btn-ghost">Upstream dux newsletter</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
